WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.131
A curriculum vitae organizes years into posts and

00:00:04.131 --> 00:00:08.077
publications. It rarely records uncertainty, strain or

00:00:08.077 --> 00:00:10.927
the cost of being constantly evaluated.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:19.766
Finish the experiment, submit the draft, apply for the

00:00:19.766 --> 00:00:22.891
next award. A system can keep moving the point at

00:00:22.891 --> 00:00:23.210
which

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.215
its members are allowed to rest.

00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:33.472
Good supervision offers criticism that improves the

00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:37.071
science without confusing professional standards with

00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:38.497
personal humiliation.

00:00:43.092 --> 00:00:46.854
Academic work asks for persistence, but turning every

00:00:46.854 --> 00:00:50.106
sacrifice into a badge of commitment produces

00:00:50.106 --> 00:00:50.829
incentives

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:51.964
worth examining.

00:00:56.717 --> 00:00:59.978
Scientific institutions should ask which parts of

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:00.311
their

00:01:00.311 --> 00:01:03.644
incentives make research needlessly cruel, not only

00:01:03.644 --> 00:01:05.931
whether students can tolerate them.

00:01:10.842 --> 00:01:14.227
The essay asks how young researchers can pursue

00:01:14.227 --> 00:01:14.875
ambitious

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:18.484
work without having their personal lives treated as

00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:19.758
disposable inputs.
